5) Design Tokens (for the landing page builder)

Colors

Primary:
	•	Turquoise #40E0D0 (signature: possibility + clarity)  ￼
	•	Gold #FFD700 (premium + achievement)  ￼
	•	White #FFFFFF (space + sophistication)  ￼

Secondary:
	•	Deep Navy #1B2B3A (grounding + readability)  ￼
	•	Warm Charcoal #4A4A4A (secondary text/UI)  ￼
	•	Soft Cream #F8F6F0 (warm background option)  ￼

Gradient:
	•	Gold Gradient #CCC08B → #9D8752 (premium overlays/buttons)  ￼

Contrast rules
	•	On Turquoise: white for large headlines; deep navy for body; optional navy overlay for heavy text.  ￼
	•	On Gold: deep navy for text; don’t use gold as a long-form background; treat as accent.  ￼
	•	On White: turquoise for headings/CTAs; deep navy for body; gold for accents.  ￼

Typography
	•	Headlines: Montserrat (Bold/SemiBold)  ￼
	•	Body: Open Sans (Regular/Light)  ￼
	•	Luxury accent (rare): Playfair Display  ￼

Suggested web hierarchy (recommended defaults)
	•	H1: 52–60px Montserrat Bold
	•	H2: 36–44px Montserrat SemiBold
	•	H3: 24–28px Montserrat SemiBold
	•	Body: 16–18px Open Sans Regular
	•	Small: 14–15px Open Sans Regular  ￼

Layout style rules
	•	Generous whitespace, clean grid, minimal clutter
	•	Rounded “card” containers for lists/checklists
	•	Turquoise as confident background panels; gold as accents (underline, badge, number, divider)
	•	Premium but approachable (no loud, dense, aggressive layouts)  ￼

