6) Photography + Visual Direction (for hero + section images)

Visual concept

Effortless luxury in motion: candid, present, flow-state. Elevated lifestyle, but grounded in meaning and real momentum.  ￼

Must-have traits
	•	Natural light (golden hour / dappled shade), texture details, negative space  ￼
	•	Movement: mid-stride, working with intention, horizon gaze, travel transitions  ￼
	•	Environments: boutique café, terrace, villa, lounge, curated spaces; marble/brass/textiles  ￼

Avoid list (hard no)

Corporate office vibes, stress imagery, staged stock-photo laptop posing, flashy logos, money stacks.  ￼  ￼

