11) QA Checklist (before publishing)

Brand alignment
	•	Relatable luxury achieved (polished + approachable)  ￼
	•	No hype / no get-rich-quick / no hustle culture  ￼
	•	Clear pillar focus (one primary pillar is obvious)  ￼

Design integrity
	•	Correct palette usage + contrast rules  ￼
	•	Montserrat/Open Sans hierarchy consistent  ￼
	•	Plenty of whitespace; no clutter  ￼
	•	Gold used as accent, not long-form background  ￼

Conversion clarity
	•	One primary CTA repeated consistently
	•	Proof appears above the fold or shortly after
	•	Offer described in plain language
	•	FAQ addresses core objections
	•	Final CTA is singular and confident  ￼

